    "project_purpose": "ZooDAO is a yield-bearing NFT battle arena on Moonbeam where users stake NFTs and tokens to earn rewards. It combines gamified NFT competitions with DeFi yield strategies, allowing participants to vote on battles and earn yield from integrated lending markets.",
